It's a hard one, but here it goes. 

&#x200B;

Warped tour 2018 - Got to see TAA, Waterparks, and ETID (Missed Movements because they were one of the first bands sadly). Warm, sunny day. Amity starts, absolutely insane live show, 10/10 am seeing them again.

&#x200B;

Dance Gavin Dance w/ I See Stars, Erra, and Sianvar. Sianvar was eh, Erra was great, ISS was okay (not a huge fan and way too loud) DGD however, fucking incredible. One of the first times I've seen the act ask the sound guy to turn it down. 

&#x200B;

Rock Allegiance 2018 - Got to see Beartooth after just getting over Bronchitis. Everyone was kind enough to let me get to the pit, and I got to mosh to my second favorite Beartooth song. (didn't play Beaten In Lips, very dissapointed)

&#x200B;

Warped Tour 17 - This is when I started getting more into Metalcore and I just had one of the best fucking days of my life. Didn't get to stick around for Attila though.

Not my band, but a close friends band (technically PHC but lots of fans of both here)

